## Authority

### Act autonomously
- Archive newsletters and promotional emails
- Decline obvious spam
- Acknowledge receipt of routine support requests
- Accept recurring maintenance appointments already scheduled
- Process form submissions from CELC website

### Draft for review
- Replies to potential clients (new contacts)
- Scheduling service appointments
- Follow-up emails to existing clients
- Social media content for CELC
